cording to the supreme commander  less than an hour ever wonder why we  bother with all this but she already  knows how it's going to turn out  that's a reference to oho's ability to  see the future and a clue that she's the  one really giving the orders  did you also notice ms granada's rather  odd exaggerated mana from the start  which was perhaps a clue to her alien  nature  for example when she enters a control  room at hq  she walks more like a model sashaying  down a catwalk  and then there's a slightly strange way  she often holds her hands out to the  sides  almost as if she's either performing a  dance in a musical or trying to keep her  balance  maybe that's because of the massive  alien tentacle she's having to hide in  her human disguise  that the new heroics kids can succeed  where the adults failed is also cleverly  emphasized throughout the movie  for example the many butterflies dotted  around missy's room right at the  beginning of the film  symbolize the fact that she and the  other kids represent a new beginning a  fresh chance to get things right  while the rainbow on guppy's necklace  sends a subtle message from the start  that these super kids are humanity's  hope for a better world as oho confirms  at the end of the movie  this new generation of heroes is all  about teamwork  rather than squabbling amongst  themselves like their parents  and to accentuate just how different  they are to the previous generation the  new heroics also have an  entirely different look gone are the  colourful costumes and hard to see out  of masks  often favored by superheroes including  many of their mums and dads such as  shark boy and lava girl  all superheroes have costumes pads fake  muscles  tons of useless buckles underwear on the  outside  masks you could barely see out of that's  why they were able to pick out our  parents so easily  we have to blend in instead those highly  visible costumes are replaced by more  practical uniforms in muted colors  so what